selecting that target ahead of the sequential fallback.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Classify accepted JAL/JALR link-register calls and canonical returns, then emit compact RAS push/pop update signals only when the instruction is not flushed.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Add and wire a four-entry return-address stack whose state changes only for accepted decode instructions, preserving the existing nret=1 RVFI contract.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Continue validating the predicted successor against the resolved JALR target so empty, noncanonical, or stale RAS predictions recover exactly once.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed nested-call, return, empty-stack, and branch-flush-before-call tests, including RVFI PC sequencing through recovery.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Accept the RAS top and recognize canonical ABI return JALRs, selecting that target ahead of the sequential fallback.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Classify accepted JAL/JALR link-register calls and canonical returns, then emit compact RAS push/pop update signals only when the instruction is not flushed.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Add and wire a four-entry return-address stack whose state changes only for accepted decode instructions, preserving the existing nret=1 RVFI contract.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Continue validating the predicted successor against the resolved JALR target so empty, noncanonical, or stale RAS predictions recover exactly once.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed nested-call, return, empty-stack, and branch-flush-before-call tests, including RVFI PC sequencing through recovery.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 284.75, \"