ource values, and precise bus-stall behavior.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Expose the combinationally extracted, sign/zero-extended load value as a dedicated forwarding result alongside the existing MEM/WB capture path.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/forward_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Distinguish an EX/MEM load from an ALU producer so the youngest matching source selects the late load-data bypass rather than its address result.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add the MEM-stage load-data input to the EX operand muxes and use it for immediately dependent ALU, store-data, branch, and JALR operands.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove the fixed load-use bubble while retaining dmem-ready holds, redirect recovery, and all other pipeline interlocks.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire the MEM load-result bypass and load classification through the forwarding network without changing the nret=1 top-level contract.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add adjacent load-to-ALU, load-to-store, load-to-branch, and random dmem-backpressure tests covering forwarding, stalls, and one retirement per instruction.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Expose the combinationally extracted, sign/zero-extended load value as a dedicated forwarding result alongside the existing MEM/WB capture path.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/forward_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Distinguish an EX/MEM load from an ALU producer so the youngest matching source selects the late load-data bypass rather than its address result.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add the MEM-stage load-data input to the EX operand muxes and use it for immediately dependent ALU, store-data, branch, and 