eserve redirect-over-stall priority at the frontend boundary.\"}, {\"file\"=>\"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\"=>\"Separate frontend queue consumption from dmem pipeline holding so a full or flushed queue backpressures fetch without allowing younger instructions into held execute state.\"}, {\"file\"=>\"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\"=>\"Consume only a valid queue head when ID/EX can advance, retaining bubble, flush, and RVFI source-observation semantics.\"}, {\"file\"=>\"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\"=>\"Add directed and random imem/dmem-stall tests for queue fill and drain, redirect flushing, branch prediction recovery, RVFI order, and no duplicate retirement.\"}]}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
