ndling.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Dispatch divide/remainder operations to the divider exactly once, retain their ID/EX payload while busy, and write the completed selected quotient or remainder into EX/MEM once.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Add execute-unit busy backpressure that freezes younger fetch and decode work while preserving dmem-stall and redirect priorities.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire divider request, completion, and busy signals through the existing single-retire pipeline without changing the external IO or RVFI boundary.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add compact helpers or control classification for identifying divide and remainder ALU operations at execute dispatch.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed signed and unsigned DIV/REM dependency, divider-busy, redirect, and dmem-backpressure tests that check exact results and one in-order RVFI retirement per instruction.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 7, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/alu.sv\", \"description\": \"Remove real combinational DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU expressions from the normal ALU result path while retaining the exact ALTOPS equations used by formal.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/divider_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Add one signedness-normalized radix-four iterative divider with request, busy, done, quotient, and remainder interfaces plus divide-by-zero and INT_MIN/-1 handling.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Dispatch divide/remainder operations to the divider exactly once, retain their ID/EX payload while busy, and write the completed selected quotient or remainder into EX/MEM once.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Add execute-unit busy backpressure that freezes younger fetch and decode work while preserving dmem-stall and redirect priorities.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/c