tl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Latch IF prediction metadata beside the decoded instruction into ID/EX.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Compare predicted and resolved next PCs, producing a recovery redirect and flush only for control-flow mispredictions.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire prediction metadata and misprediction recovery through the pipeline and hazard control.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Replace unconditional EX-control-flow flushing with misprediction-only flushing while retaining load and bus-stall priorities.\"\n  - file: test/test_predictor.py\n    description: \"Add directed BTFNT, direct-JAL, fall-through, and misprediction-recovery tests including RVFI PC sequencing.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
