MMIO stores, enqueue eligible stores without waiting for dmemReady, and keep loads ordered behind an occupied buffer.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace unconditional store dmem holds with load/MMIO ordering stalls and buffer-full backpressure while retaining all existing redirect priorities.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire the store buffer onto the unchanged dmem ports and connect occupancy, drain, and acceptance signals to MEM and hazard control.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add any compact pipeline metadata needed to distinguish buffered stores from loads and strongly ordered MMIO accesses.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add random dmem-stalled store streams, store-to-load ordering, partial-byte stores, UART/MMIO marker ordering, and RVFI single-retirement checks.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/store_buffer.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a one-entry valid/ready store queue that retains aligned address, replicated write data, and byte mask until an acknowledged dmem write.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Classify normal RAM versus strongly ordered MMIO stores, enqueue eligible stores without waiting for dmemReady, and keep loads ordered behind an occupied buffer.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Replace unconditional store dmem holds with load/MMIO ordering stalls and buffer-full backpressure while retaining all existing redirect priorities.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire the store buffer onto the unchanged dmem ports and connect occupancy, drain, and acceptance signals to MEM and hazard control.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add any compact pipeline metadata needed to distinguish buffered stores from loads and strongly ordered MMIO accesses.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.