ational PC-indexed lookup, BTFNT-compatible cold entries, and one qualified EX-stage training port.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use the predictor direction only for validated conditional branches, retaining immediate-only target formation, direct-JAL prediction, and BTFNT fallback on cold table entries.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Emit the resolved conditional-branch PC and architectural direction as a training event only when EX advances, excluding stalled or trapped branch targets.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Instantiate and wire the direction predictor between IF and EX without changing the nret=1 top-level or RVFI retirement interface.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed cold-start, saturating-counter, forward-biased, loop-exit, misprediction-recovery, and dmem-stall training tests with RVFI PC-order checks.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/branch_predictor.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a small direct-mapped valid-plus-two-bit direction table with combinational PC-indexed lookup, BTFNT-compatible cold entries, and one qualified EX-stage training port.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Use the predictor direction only for validated conditional branches, retaining immediate-only target formation, direct-JAL prediction, and BTFNT fallback on cold table entries.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Emit the resolved conditional-branch PC and architectural direction as a training event only when EX advances, excluding stalled or trapped branch targets.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Instantiate and wire the direction predictor between IF and EX without changing the nret=1 top-level or RVFI retirement interface.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed cold-start, saturating-counter, 